    """
    When a person last decided the space: confirming in the inbox (also keeping it), moving or handing the document over, choosing it on upload, or a migration; null while the pipeline or rules placed it. Such documents teach the classifier the space.
    """
    processing: Processing
    created_at: Annotated[AwareDatetime, Field(title="Created At")]
    """
    When the document came in: when Lekto received it, unless a migration took over the source system's date or it was set since (`PATCH`). `sort=created_at` orders by it.
    """
    updated_at: Annotated[AwareDatetime, Field(title="Updated At")]
    rules: Annotated[list[RuleReportOut] | None, Field(title="Rules")] = None
    """
    For editors: the rules the change set off (they hold now and did not before) and what they did. Nothing turns yellow; what could not be applied is listed.
    """


