    """
    When a person last set or confirmed the metadata (in the inbox, or by changing contact, type, topic, tags, date or fields; adding or removing tags set by hand alone does not count), or it was taken over with the source system's; null while it is the pipeline's own. Confirmed documents train the classifier.
    """
    space_confirmed_at: Annotated[AwareDatetime | None, Field(title="Space Confirmed At")] = None
    """
    When a person last decided the space: confirming in the inbox (also keeping it), moving or handing the document over, choosing it on upload, or a migration; null while the pipeline or rules placed it. Such documents teach the classifier the space.
    """
    processing: Processing
    created_at: Annotated[AwareDatetime, Field(title="Created At")]
    """
    When the document came in: when Lekto received it, unless a migration took over the source system's date or it was set since (`PATCH`). `sort=created_at` orders by it.
    """
    updated_at: Annotated[AwareDatetime, Field(title="Updated At")]
    in_inbox: Annotated[bool, Field(title="In Inbox")]
    """
    It stands open in the caller's inbox (`GET /inbox`; with `all_users`, in every user's): in processing, yellow, red, or new and not seen by the caller.
    """


